category: Libs
requires: libgexecutor0 libglib2.0-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Small library based on GObject that simplifies the creation and managing of child processes (development)"
ldesc: "The libgexecutor is a small library, based on GLib2 - GObject, that simplifies
the creation and managing of child processes, for programs based on
glib-GObject."
external-source: libgexecutor

